INCLUDING DATA LOSS, DEVICE FAILURE OR BUSINESS INTERRUPTION. THIS DOES NOT
EXCLUDE OR LIMIT LIABILITY THAT APPLICABLE LAW DOES NOT ALLOW TO BE EXCLUDED.

6. Termination and reserved rights
Violation terminates the permissions granted under this license. To the extent
permitted by applicable law, unauthorized use, copying, modification and
distribution must cease, and copies without a continuing lawful basis must be
deleted. All rights not expressly granted are reserved.

This English text is a reference translation. The Chinese version prevails in
